<title>USA: Sport says to repurchase up to 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Sport says to repurchase up to 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sport Supply Group Inc said Thursday that it approved the repurchase of up to one million shares of its common stock in the open market and/or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3/8 at 6-3/4 in mid-morning trading Thursday.</p>
</text>
